      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "A step declares GRAPH TYPOLOGIES, not paths",
      "prov:value": "The first draft used `inputs` throughout and `check:declared-paths` rejected nine literals."
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/ui/ui-core/incremental-render.md#provenance-4",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "The subprocess, and why there is one",
      "prov:value": "An earlier version of this was correct and silent — it degraded to a full render without a word, so the feature was inert (0 steps cached) and nothing in the output said why."
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/ui/ui-core/incremental-render.md#provenance-5",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "Hash content, never mtime",
      "prov:value": "`byCodepoint` in `render-selection.ts` is the comparator, and it exists because the first draft used `localeCompare`."
    },
