      "cat-harness:section": "Measured, on this repository",
      "prov:value": "The last row is the coarseness above, measured rather than asserted: a skill edit moves the `cat-harness` graph, `kg-current` reads that graph, and everything `needs` its way back to `kg-current`."
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/ui/ui-core/incremental-render.md#provenance-8",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "Measured, on this repository",
      "prov:value": "And the counts must add up: the first draft reported *\"10 ran … 8 served from the seed\"*, double-counting eight of them, because the runner records a step as having run whenever the callback returned no error and a cached step returns no error by doing nothing."
    },
